sequenceDiagram
%% process-key: software-delivery
    participant role_product_owner as Product owner
    participant role_delivery_manager as Delivery manager
    participant role_solution_architect as Solution architect
    participant role_lead_engineer as Lead engineer
    participant role_qa_lead as QA lead
    participant role_security_reviewer as Security reviewer
    participant role_release_manager as Release manager
    participant system as Multi-team software delivery and release governance
    role_product_owner->>system: Clarify scope and release boundary
    system-->>role_product_owner: evidence -> Scope boundary packet
    role_solution_architect->>system: Review architecture and canonical-model impact
    system-->>role_solution_architect: evidence -> Architecture decision record
    role_lead_engineer->>system: Implement feature, tests, and migration notes
    system-->>role_lead_engineer: evidence -> Implementation change set, Migration and rollout preparation checklist
    role_lead_engineer->>system: Complete peer review and integration readiness
    system-->>role_lead_engineer: evidence -> Peer review note
    role_qa_lead->>system: Run QA validation and browser proof
    system-->>role_qa_lead: evidence -> Regression evidence pack
    role_product_owner->>system: Perform security and data-handling review
    system-->>role_product_owner: evidence -> Security exception assessment
    role_product_owner->>system: Approve release readiness
    system-->>role_product_owner: evidence -> Release approval record
    role_release_manager->>system: Execute controlled release rollout
    system-->>role_release_manager: evidence -> Deployment and telemetry watch log
    role_delivery_manager->>system: Capture post-release learning and corrective actions
    system-->>role_delivery_manager: evidence -> Post-release learning review
